      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "もっと資材があれば、宿屋の調理場をさらに直して\nさらに美味しい料理を出せると思うのです。\nこのご時世に、我が儘なのは承知ですが、\n資材に余裕があれば分けてやってください。",
        "official_en": "If we had more materials, we could make more\nrepairs to the kitchen and make our food even\ntastier. I know it's selfish to ask in times like this, but\ncould you share a few more supplies with us?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
